{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段，叙事句与感受词仍然偏密，纵向交替扫读不如X的双栏结构顺手。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的双栏分工清楚，普通观众边听边扫更容易，但感受词相对概括，部分音乐变化和人物心理之间的联系没有充分展开。Y用【】抓住每段核心，又把舍不得亲近与不愿再受委屈之间的矛盾讲得更透，人物为什么反复动摇也更容易理解。尤其Y的分时感受能跟随音乐变化，旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等意象反复出现又发生变化，使音乐细节和人物经历形成呼应，整体叙事更有层次，感受也更具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa210f2c-a282-4fd4-a695-bd8ede043651", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T183048677459Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:32:16.395704+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c004b6cf36f9d5d8f59bc25025471b338d92a35b0f42c6d8962d84061aab9ed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta